{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-prediction-accuracy","title":"预测准确度与可干预性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-retention-repurchase/churn-prediction/churn-prediction-accuracy","wordCount":2095,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"预测准确度与可干预性\">预测准确度与可干预性</h1><p>一个团队花三个月做出 AUC 0.87 的流失模型，上线两周后复盘发现挽回率没有变化。这不是失败案例，这是<strong>行业常态</strong>——原因不在模型不够准，而在问题问错了。流失预测回答的是「谁会走」，但运营真正需要的是「谁<strong>在被打扰之后</strong>会留下来」。这两个问题的答案集合并不重合，而它们的差集正是浪费预算的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四象限与干预增益\">核心概念：四象限与干预增益</h2><p>把用户按两个维度切成四格：他是否会流失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>），以及他是否会对干预有反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[全部用户] --&gt; B{会流失吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|会| C{干预有反应吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|不会| D{干预有反应吗}&#10;    C --&gt;|有| E[可挽回者: 值得干预]&#10;    C --&gt;|无| F[必失者: 干预浪费]&#10;    D --&gt;|有| G[易感者: 干预反而有害]&#10;    D --&gt;|无| H[自然留存者: 干预浪费]&#10;    E --&gt; I[目标人群]&#10;    F --&gt; J[放弃]&#10;    G --&gt; K[绝不打扰]&#10;    H --&gt; L[放弃]\">graph TD\n    A[全部用户] --&gt; B{会流失吗}\n    B --&gt;|会| C{干预有反应吗}\n    B --&gt;|不会| D{干预有反应吗}\n    C --&gt;|有| E[可挽回者: 值得干预]\n    C --&gt;|无| F[必失者: 干预浪费]\n    D --&gt;|有| G[易感者: 干预反而有害]\n    D --&gt;|无| H[自然留存者: 干预浪费]\n    E --&gt; I[目标人群]\n    F --&gt; J[放弃]\n    G --&gt; K[绝不打扰]\n    H --&gt; L[放弃]</pre><p>四格的商业含义完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可挽回者（persuadable）</strong>：不做干预会走，做了会留。这是唯一的正收益目标。</li>\n<li><strong>必失者（lost causes）</strong>：无论怎么干预都会走。预测模型会把他们排在最前面（因为他们的流失概率最高），但给他们发券是纯亏损。</li>\n<li><strong>自然留存者（sure things）</strong>：你不做任何事他也会复购。给他发券等于把本来就有的收入打折——<strong>这是最常见也最隐蔽的资损</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>易感者（do-not-disturb）</strong>：本来会留，被打扰反而走了（频繁推送引发退订、大额券让用户等待下次促销才买）。这一格的存在让「多发总比少发好」的直觉彻底失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>传统的流失模型只预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>，于是它把预算按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 排序，命中大量必失者与自然留存者。真正的目标函数是<strong>干预增益</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x) = P(Y=1 \\mid T=0, x) - P(Y=1 \\mid T=1, x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「不干预时的流失概率」减「干预时的流失概率」。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 大的人才是该干预的人。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>建模方式</th>\n<th>预测目标</th>\n<th>需要的训练数据</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流失分类</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y=1 \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全量历史</td>\n<td>排序与增益无关，浪费严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应分类</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>转化</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{转化} \\mid T=1, x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">转化</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅干预组</td>\n<td>忽略自然复购，高估效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双模型差分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat P_0 - \\hat P_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>干预组 + 对照组</td>\n<td>两模型误差相减会放大噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Uplift 直接建模</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接拟合</td>\n<td>干预组 + 对照组</td>\n<td>实现复杂，需实验数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"双模型差分-最实用的起点\">双模型差分：最实用的起点</h2><p>最易落地的做法是训练两个模型：一个只用对照组数据拟合「不干预的留存概率」，一个只用干预组数据拟合「干预后的留存概率」，两者的差即为增益估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\tau(x) = \\hat P_0(x) - \\hat P_1(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>它有三个必须处理的陷阱。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱一：两组样本量差异巨大。</strong> 对照组通常远小于干预组（真实系统里 holdout 常只有 5%–10%）。解决方式是对两组分别做倾向性加权，或者把两个模型都建立在同一批特征上并共享一部分表示。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：误差相减放大噪声。</strong> 两个独立模型的预测误差方差相加，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计会非常抖。实用的缓解手段是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做保序回归单调化，或者对特征空间做分箱后在箱内估计平均增益（T-learner 的分箱近似），牺牲个体精度换稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：外推不可靠。</strong> 干预组里没有「未被干预的高价值用户」样本，如果对照组与干预组的用户构成不同（例如干预只发给了活跃用户），模型学到的是「活跃用户的增益」，用于全量时会系统性偏差。这是为什么<strong>对照组必须随机抽取</strong>而不是「挑一批不发的用户」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"uplift-建模与评估\">Uplift 建模与评估</h2><p>直接建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的经典方法是把干预变量作为特征或作为树的划分准则。两种主流路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>S-learner</strong>：单模型，把「是否干预」当普通特征喂进去，预测时分别设为 0 和 1 求差。简单，但当干预信号弱时模型倾向于忽略它。</li>\n<li><strong>因果树 / 因果森林</strong>：以增益为分裂准则，让树直接寻找「增益差异大」的特征切分。对稀疏的正增益更敏感。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>更工程化的路线是<strong>元学习器组合</strong>：X-learner 在小对照组场景下表现更稳，R-learner 适合有倾向性得分的场景。</p>\n<p>评估增益模型不能看 AUC——增益没有「真实标签」。三个可用指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>判读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Qini 系数</td>\n<td>按增益排序后累积增益曲线与随机线的面积差</td>\n<td>越大越好，&gt;0 才有正收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Uplift@K</td>\n<td>前 K% 干预人群的实际增益</td>\n<td>直接对应预算下的收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分位数增益曲线</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 十分位分组的实际增益</td>\n<td>应单调递减，否则模型无效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分位数增益曲线是必须做的诊断</strong>：把用户按预测增益分成十组，在每组内做小规模随机实验（该组内一半干预一半不干预），算出真实增益。如果真实增益不随预测增益单调下降，模型就没有排序能力——即使 Qini 是正的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[历史实验数据] --&gt; B[干预组 + 对照组]&#10;    B --&gt; C[训练增益模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按预测增益分十组]&#10;    D --&gt; E[每组内做小规模随机实验]&#10;    E --&gt; F[计算各组真实增益]&#10;    F --&gt; G{单调下降?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[模型可用于预算分配]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[回退: 改用期望价值排序]\">graph TD\n    A[历史实验数据] --&gt; B[干预组 + 对照组]\n    B --&gt; C[训练增益模型]\n    C --&gt; D[按预测增益分十组]\n    D --&gt; E[每组内做小规模随机实验]\n    E --&gt; F[计算各组真实增益]\n    F --&gt; G{单调下降?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[模型可用于预算分配]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[回退: 改用期望价值排序]</pre><h2 id=\"增益的时效性-延迟效应与衰减\">增益的时效性：延迟效应与衰减</h2><p>复购干预有一个流失分类所没有的复杂性：<strong>效应有延迟</strong>。用户收到一条补货提醒后，可能三天后下单，也可能因为记住了这次提醒而在下次真正需要时直接搜索——后者是「提醒有效」但归因窗口内看不到的情况。</p>\n<p>两种错误因此同时存在：<strong>短窗口低估</strong>（把延迟收益算丢了）、<strong>长窗口高估</strong>（把自然复购算进来了）。判定标准只有一个：窗口内对照组也发生了同等比例的复购，那么多出来的部分才是增益。所以增益的测量窗口必须与对照组同步，且窗口长度应该覆盖该品类的一个典型复购周期。</p>\n<p>衰减则来自另一侧：同一个用户被反复干预，边际增益会下降。这解释了为什么在增益模型里加入「近期干预次数」作为特征通常会有明显收益——高频被干预的用户，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应当被显著压低。这个特征与触达频控的设计（见 <a href=\"../retention-measure/retention-frequency-guard\">触达频控与用户疲劳</a>）是同一件事的两个视角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候该放弃增益建模\">什么时候该放弃增益建模</h2><p>增益建模需要实验数据，而实验数据的获取有成本。三种情况下不必一开始就上：历史完全没有随机实验记录（此时先建立 holdout 机制更重要，见 <a href=\"../retention-measure/retention-ltv-metric\">留存率、LTV 与挽回 ROI</a>）；干预动作的成本极低（例如站内信，此时按概率排序的浪费可接受）；以及用户规模很小（增益估计的方差会大到没有指导意义）。</p>\n<p>一个务实的推进顺序是：先建立随机 holdout → 用双模型差分拿到粗粒度增益 → 在分位数分组上验证单调性 → 再决定是否投入因果森林这类更重的方案。跳过第一步直接做模型，会得到一个无法被验证的系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流失预测回答「谁会走」，增长需要的是「谁值得挽留」——两者的差集就是浪费的预算。</li>\n<li>四象限中只有「可挽回者」是正收益目标；「自然留存者」上的补贴是最隐蔽的资损，「易感者」说明多发可能有害。</li>\n<li>目标函数应为干预增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x) = P(Y{=}1 \\mid T{=}0) - P(Y{=}1 \\mid T{=}1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是流失概率。</li>\n<li>双模型差分是最实用的起点，但要处理样本量差异、误差放大与外推偏差三个陷阱。</li>\n<li>增益模型不能用 AUC 评估；Qini 与 Uplift@K 是主指标，分位数增益曲线的单调性是发布门槛。</li>\n<li>对照组必须随机抽取；「挑一批不发的用户」会让增益估计系统性偏差。</li>\n<li>增益有时效：测量窗口必须覆盖一个典型复购周期，且必须与对照组同步。</li>\n<li>没有随机实验数据时，先建立 holdout 机制，再谈模型——顺序反了会得到一个无法验证的系统。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预测准确度与可干预性","id":"预测准确度与可干预性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四象限与干预增益","id":"核心概念-四象限与干预增益"},{"level":2,"text":"双模型差分：最实用的起点","id":"双模型差分-最实用的起点"},{"level":2,"text":"Uplift 建模与评估","id":"uplift-建模与评估"},{"level":2,"text":"增益的时效性：延迟效应与衰减","id":"增益的时效性-延迟效应与衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候该放弃增益建模","id":"什么时候该放弃增益建模"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流失评分与人群分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-retention-repurchase/churn-prediction/churn-score-segment"},"next":{"title":"复购周期预测（消耗品与季节品）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-retention-repurchase/repurchase-timing/repurchase-cycle-predict"}}